// Two universes, one numeric id (the placement correspondence, § 3
// case 12). Each `PadN` is two sites (the declaration and the `run`
// the omitted-run desugar adds), so the 106 pads put `Collider` at
// seed 0, index 212: the id the stdlib analysis copy, minted alone
// from seed 0 and index 0, gives `__StdIoUdpReader`. The test asserts
// the collision before anything else, so a stdlib edit that moves the
// reader is a red test and a new padding count, never a vacuous pass.
